 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Schrift X — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to apply your cursed seals onto others, allowing for even more accurate and deadly shots. When you use a mark, any previous marks you have active ends.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Critical Mark:</strong> As a bonus action for 3 CE, you can mark a target of your choice within 30 feet for 1 minute. If you hit the marked target with an attack, your next attack against the target is made at advantage. On a hit, the attack deals critical damage and the mark ends.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Multi-Mark:</strong> As a bonus action for 3 CE, you can mark a number of targets up to your CE modifier within 30 feet for 1 minute. As an action, you can make a ranged attack and activate the marks, causing the attack to split and attack each marked target within range of your attack. You make a ranged weapon or cursed energy attack roll against each creature, dealing your normal damage on a hit and the mark ends.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
